{
  "name": "Shared Budget · 3 Example run",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shared Budget · Example run\nA stand-in for your own workflow: a run gets a list of items and makes one short model call per item, through the budgeted sub-workflow.\n\n`POST budget/run/postgres` or `budget/run/data-table` with `{ \"items\": [{ \"id\": \"a1\", \"text\": \"...\" }] }`. Optional: `budget`, `cap_usd`, `on_over_budget`.\n\n**Use the answer** is where your workflow goes on. `ai: false` means the item took the path without the model.\n\n`POST budget/status/postgres` or `budget/status/data-table` with `{ \"budget_key\": \"ai:2026-01-31\" }` shows what the ledger holds.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "266cbdc2-afe2-4307-8bbf-1432f7e12139",
      "name": "About",
